1
00:00:00,114 --> 00:00:02,784
(Sheldon:)...ie, when your locus coeruleus
sits around the house...

2
00:00:02,992 --> 00:00:05,082
(Sheldon:)...it sits around the house.

3
00:00:09,082 --> 00:00:10,582
(Sheldon:)Oh.

4
00:00:10,792 --> 00:00:13,502
(Amy:)- Are we nervous, Dr. Cooper?
- No.

5
00:00:13,711 --> 00:00:19,341
(Sheldon:)What you see
is a man trembling with confidence.

6
00:00:22,762 --> 00:00:25,142
Does the Iocus coeruleus
normally bleed that much?

7
00:00:25,348 --> 00:00:27,728
(Amy:)No, but your thumb does.

8
00:00:30,770 --> 00:00:32,980
(Sheldon:)Oh, dear.

9
00:00:35,650 --> 00:00:38,940
(Amy:)Yeah, you're a biologist.

10
00:00:43,408 --> 00:00:44,618
(Howard:)What are you doing here?

11
00:00:45,201 --> 00:00:46,911
(Sheldon:)I'm on vacation.

12
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:51,620
(Sheldon:)Social convention dictates that I let
my hair down at a local watering hole.

13
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:58,020
(Sheldon:)Social convention is stupid.

